# Generated
shared/proto/gen/
shared/openapi/gen/
# Generated gRPC stubs ARE committed: the Docker build context is gateway-go/
# only, so it cannot reach shared/proto/ to regenerate them. Committing them
# (standard practice for protobuf) lets any machine build without protoc.
# Regenerate with `make proto` after editing shared/proto/*.proto.
#gateway-go/internal/repository/proto/
#backend-python/app/repository/grpc/gen/
